      "voice_role": "dialogue:mr_white",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "text": "\"You didn't see him. I'm afraid of what might come back.\"",
      "text_sha256": "7b27237e359fd3b7714d5cf68df5ee520edc7097d863add159d3448ccda57c6c",
      "word_count": 11,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/the_monkeys_paw/run_sf_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part2_c10.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c11",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "mrs_white",
      "speaker": "mrs_white",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:mrs_white",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "text": "\"He's our son!\"",
      "text_sha256": "624b34e81b28601b20d3f39514370e374a638d12832aa02f17e53551a4178acf",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/the_monkeys_paw/run_sf_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part2_c11.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c12",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "text": "At last, Mr. White went downstairs and found the paw. His wife followed. His voice shook.",
      "text_sha256": "7e6149ce474d96cb8413c2fba4338489baba6acd4717d32fca951857f56a1148",
      "word_count": 16,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/the_monkeys_paw/run_sf_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part2_c12.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c1",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "mr_white",
      "speaker": "mr_white",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:mr_white",
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "text": "\"I wish Herbert alive again.\"",
      "text_sha256": "ecd1643f35e6179fb1c0b7dc794baa9bc3cb22c2b4f49dbc77196e627baa53dc",
      "word_count": 5,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/the_monkeys_paw/run_sf_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c2",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "text": "It fell from his hand. They waited in the dark, listening to the clock. Then came a soft knock.",
      "text_sha256": "d78569e37e11a6313271d59280531edbdbf15ae0e7d5f381964d17c67ce430ed",
      "word_count": 19,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/the_monkeys_paw/run_sf_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c3",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "mrs_white",
      "speaker": "mrs_white",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:mrs_white",
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "text": "\"Herbert!\"",
      "text_sha256": "fa3641bf2c5b709dbaa96a718e396714829b6eb4ffc40aa3a33a9f1961804a1d",
      "word_count": 1,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/the_monkeys_paw/run_sf_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c4",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        24,
        25,
        26
      ],
      "text": "Mrs. White rushed towards the door. Her husband caught her arm, but she pulled free. The knocking grew louder. She dragged a chair to the front door and climbed onto it to reach the high bolt. Mr. White dropped to his knees. Where was the paw? His fingers swept across the boards as the knocking shook the door.",
      "text_sha256": "25a8fb994717aaad42434c9feea11801de9cd0cae35c81d8d0a217e0fab22f47",
      "word_count": 58,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/the_monkeys_paw/run_sf_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c5",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "mr_white",
      "speaker": "mr_white",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:mr_white",
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "text": "\"Wait!\"",
      "text_sha256": "ec419d6e62c10d3b819f81ac12e3c117284d1f6e95f2a7e7b79910ae1fbc70ff",
      "word_count": 1,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/the_monkeys_paw/run_sf_prod_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c6",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        28,
        29,
        30,
        31
      ],
      "text": "The chair scraped. The last bolt began to slide. His fingers closed around the paw. Just as his wife was about to open the door, he made his third and last wish. The terrible knocking stopped. She pulled the door open. There was nobody there. Cold wind swept into the house, and her long wail of loss rose into the night. The street lamp opposite shone on a quiet, deserted road.",
      "text_sha256": "fb104ffcc372afe6b750084a2782854c5d0222eed7cef5e92633ede2b2b12268",
      "word_count": 71,
      "split_reason": "article_end(直前の分割点から続く同一Voice区間)",
